r /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/02/tsiann-ah.html\" target=\"_blank\">Tsiânn濟囡仔過往--ah</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">1</span><br /><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">呂美親<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/02/e_26.html\" target=\"_blank\">陷眠內ê唱曲</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">2</span><br /><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蕭聿萱<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_1.html\" target=\"_blank\">溫差</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">4</span><br /><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳煒翰<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_3.html\" target=\"_blank\">練台語</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">5</span></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">施足珠<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_92.html\" target=\"_blank\">山頂風景</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">6</span></div><div><br /></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">阿瑞--ā話仙</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">藍春瑞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_14.html\" target=\"_blank\">轉變</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">7</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">地名研究室</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">黃偉嘉<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_69.html\" target=\"_blank\">第一分道</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">9</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">光景bóng uē</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張寶明<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/e_3.html\" target=\"_blank\">鼓井ê記憶</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">10</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ǹg夢五四三</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">余青<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/bang.html\" target=\"_blank\">Bāng</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">12</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">文學káng「台」</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">石牧民<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/e_42.html\" target=\"_blank\">王貞文牧師台文小說ê反抗底蒂</a></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">14</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Lán來講看māi</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳育萱<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/kaptsiah-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">Kap人無仝款tsiah趣味</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/kaptsiah-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">——腔口是阮對故鄉ê感情</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">16</span></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳昭蓉<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/e_8.html\" target=\"_blank\">阮澎湖ê腔口真特別</a></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">18</span></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">廖啟助<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/beh-tshui-sak-lan-e-tang-ne.html\" target=\"_blank\">是按怎我beh tshui-sak母語？</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/beh-tshui-sak-lan-e-tang-ne.html\" target=\"_blank\">Lán ē-tàng án-ne做！</a></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">22</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">心內話</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">謝豐顁<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/e_62.html\" target=\"_blank\">母語ê堅持</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">26</span></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">高嘉徽<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/e_41.html\" target=\"_blank\">母語ê傳承</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">42</span></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">顏毓黛<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_34.html\" target=\"_blank\">一枝草，一點露</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">42</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">台灣人寫真</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳錦月<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_8.html\" target=\"_blank\">大姊</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">29</span></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">A-ian<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/e_55.html\" target=\"_blank\">一陣人組成ê樂團</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">32</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Sann-kap讀小說</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雁&nbsp; &nbsp; 翎<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_22.html\" target=\"_blank\">招弟：（一）收瀾</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">33</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">棲地復育台語講座</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／潘翰聲</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／吳玉祥<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/kam-e-pun.html\" target=\"_blank\">收碳稅，kám ē變散赤？</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/kam-e-pun.html\" target=\"_blank\">Pun紅利，逐家變好額！</a></span><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">37</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">台語sa攏有講座</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／顏娟英</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／Tân Lō͘<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/02/e_43.html\" target=\"_blank\">生活就是藝術——顏水龍ê台灣美學實踐</a></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">39</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: small;\">寫hō͘學生朋友ê代誌</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳&nbsp; &nbsp; 雷<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_77.html\" target=\"_blank\">黃昏美夢</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_77.html\" target=\"_blank\">Hông-hun Bí-bāng</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">44</span></div><div><br /></div></div></div><div style=\"font-size: x-large;\"><br /></div></div></span></div><div><span><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"